# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0000193> (cortisone reductase deficiency)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21325058") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0000193> "A disorder in which there is a failure to regenerate the active glucocorticoid cortisol from cortisone via 11beta-HSD1. The resulting lack of cortisol regeneration stimulates ACTH-mediated adrenal hyperandrogenism, with males manifesting in childhood with precocious pseudopuberty and females presenting in adolescence and early adulthood with hirsutism, oligoamenorrhea, and infertility.")
